WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.639 --> 00:00:09.439
This is the story of a conflict
of great violence

00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.720
and whose end no one can foresee.

00:00:15.279 --> 00:00:17.280
The story of a hatred
between two peoples

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:20.159
who have been fighting over the same land for decades.

00:00:25.520 --> 00:00:26.479
Suicide attacks.

00:00:30.079 --> 00:00:30.959
Air raids.

00:00:34.520 --> 00:00:35.400
Urban guerrilla warfare.

00:00:38.279 --> 00:00:41.799
Every day, the powder keg of the Middle East threatens peace.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.599
This conflict, which no one understands anymore,
began a century ago.

00:00:51.759 --> 00:00:54.360
This is the story
that we are going to tell you.

00:00:58.599 --> 00:01:03.040
Why did some Jews decide to return to Israel?

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:05.559
the ancient kingdom of Judah,

00:01:06.080 --> 00:01:07.519
After 2,000 years of exile?

00:01:10.559 --> 00:01:13.680
Why did they fight against the British colonial troops?

00:01:17.319 --> 00:01:20.239
How did they establish their dominance over the Palestinian Arabs?

00:01:21.279 --> 00:01:23.319
Just a few years
after having undergone

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:27.919
One of the greatest traumas the world has ever known: Nazism.

00:01:33.440 --> 00:01:34.480
For years,

00:01:35.279 --> 00:01:37.879
Film enthusiasts
filmed their adventures.

00:01:39.440 --> 00:01:40.480
Jews.

00:01:41.160 --> 00:01:42.040
Arabs.

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:47.040
Their films
bear witness to the violence,

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:50.839
but also
of their daily lives,

00:01:50.919 --> 00:01:53.800
of their hopes
and their dreams.

00:01:57.319 --> 00:02:01.599
We found
these amateur films for you.

00:02:05.919 --> 00:02:07.720
With Bärbel and Ella Weiler,

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:10.199
two little German Jewish girls

