before secretly joining the State of Israel.

00:02:26.960 --> 00:02:29.759
Along with the Arens,
Zionist activists.

00:02:30.119 --> 00:02:34.919
We are going to tell you the story of the tragedy
and the odyssey of the Jewish people in the 20th century.

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:39.919
We will also be with the Saïd family.

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:41.520
Arabs
from Jerusalem.

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:45.880
With the Kouri
in the city of Jaffa,

00:02:46.479 --> 00:02:49.279
as well as several actors
in the Palestinian drama.

00:02:50.960 --> 00:02:52.960
We will follow them
in their revolt

00:02:53.039 --> 00:02:54.679
and on the roads of exile.

00:02:58.119 --> 00:03:01.240
From Hitler's rise to power in 1933

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:05.199
