or on the face."

00:52:36.199 --> 00:52:39.520
"Indiscriminately,
they are beaten."

00:52:39.560 --> 00:52:42.520
"until they show no further
signs of life."

00:52:43.080 --> 00:52:44.399
"In three-quarters of an hour,"

00:52:44.719 --> 00:52:47.320
