00:54:57.679 --> 00:55:00.120
while waiting for the next group to arrive.

00:55:08.479 --> 00:55:11.639
The scale of the massacre
is unparalleled in history.

00:55:15.199 --> 00:55:19.520
In six months, the Einsatzgruppen
murdered half a million Jews.

00:55:23.719 --> 00:55:26.879
In front of his troops,
